## Requirements-test traceability

| Requirement | Verification | Evidence target | Mode | Blocking |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| AC-01 | fixed-source and three-record unit tests | tests/test_v02_calibration_disclosure.py | Automatic | Yes |
